  "description": "500W Bafang Brushless Motor\n\nThe Lankeleisi GT800 features a BAFANG M600 500W mid-drive motor, delivering up to 120Nm of torque for strong and consistent performance. Its triple sensor system—comprising one torque sensor and two speed sensors—ensures rapid power delivery, giving you an exhilarating mountain biking experience.\n\n48V 20Ah SAMSUNG Li-ion Battery\n\nThe Lankeleisi GT800 is equipped with a removable 48V 20Ah Samsung battery built with 21700 cells, offering a pedal-assist range of 120–150 km. The battery is housed internally and is both waterproof and dustproof, allowing you to ride confidently even in rainy conditions.\n\nFour-link suspension soft-tail system\n\nThe Lankeleisi GT800 features a full shock suspension system with an adjustable front fork and an adjustable rear air shock absorber. The front fork offers 120mm of travel to absorb bumps on rough terrain, providing comfortable control, while the rear air shock helps reduce rider fatigue for a smoother ride.\n\nLCD Color Display\n\nColour Backlight Display to keep track of speed, mileage, power and more.",
